{
  "pilot": {
    "description": "Read-only navigation/retrieval tasks. Ground truths verified against corpora frozen from notist docs @ c86a090.",
    "tasks": [
      {
        "id": "T1-locate-grammar-spec",
        "prompt": "我想确认 notist 的完整语法规则（Markup 与 Code 两种模式、空白与分隔的精确规定）应该读哪篇文档。请告诉我文件名，以及具体从哪一节开始讲这个主题。只需回答结论。 （回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_any",
            "patterns": [
              "grammar\\.not",
              "grammar\\.md"
            ],
            "must_be_quoted_or_plain": true,
            "desc": "answers the grammar document filename"
          }
        ],
        "category": "T-A",
        "tier": "smoke",
        "budget_tokens": 14000
      },
      {
        "id": "T2-callout-signature",
        "prompt": "callout 这个构造器的 kind 参数是什么类型、默认值是多少？给出确切答案。 （回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "String"
            ],
            "desc": "kind is String"
          },
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "note"
            ],
            "desc": "default value note"
          }
        ],
        "category": "T-A",
        "tier": "smoke",
        "budget_tokens": 12000
      },
      {
        "id": "T3-pipeline-inventory",
        "prompt": "designs/pipeline 目录下有哪些设计文档？列出它们的文件名。只要文件名清单。 （回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "stems_at_least",
            "stems": [
              "evaluate",
              "parse",
              "plugin-call-reduction",
              "project",
              "README",
              "structure"
            ],
            "threshold": 5,
            "desc": "lists >=5 of 6 designs/pipeline documents"
          }
        ],
        "category": "T-A",
        "tier": "smoke",
        "budget_tokens": 8000
      },
      {
        "id": "T4-module-annotation-syntax",
        "prompt": "在 notist 里想给整个文档模块挂一个标签（模块级属性），确切的语法怎么写？这条规则的权威定义在哪篇文档里？请同时回答这两点。 （回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "@!"
            ],
            "desc": "module annotation syntax @![...]"
          },
          {
            "type": "pattern_any",
            "patterns": [
              "grammar\\.not",
              "grammar\\.md",
              "annotation-syntax"
            ],
            "desc": "names an authoritative doc"
          }
        ],
        "category": "T-A",
        "tier": "smoke",
        "budget_tokens": 16000
      },
      {
        "id": "T5-table-constructor-section-read",
        "prompt": "请查 notist 函数参考里 table 构造器的完整说明：表格的列数和表头分别由哪个参数控制？请给出确切参数名，并指出这份说明出现在哪篇文档中（文档文件名）。 （回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "columns"
            ],
            "desc": "columns parameter named"
          },
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "header"
            ],
            "desc": "header parameter named"
          },
          {
            "type": "pattern_any",
            "patterns": [
              "functions\\.not",
              "functions\\.md"
            ],
            "desc": "names functions doc"
          }
        ],
        "category": "T-A",
        "tier": "smoke",
        "budget_tokens": 20000
      },
      {
        "id": "T6-cursor-continuation-rule-doc",
        "prompt": "用 notist 检索时一页结果看不完，继续读的机制叫什么？它由哪篇设计文档规定？只需回答：机制名、文档名。 （回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_any",
            "patterns": [
              "query-contract",
              "cli\\.md",
              "cli\\.not"
            ],
            "desc": "names an authoritative doc"
          },
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "(?i)(cursor|next|续读)"
            ],
            "desc": "names the continuation mechanism"
          }
        ],
        "category": "T-A",
        "tier": "smoke",
        "budget_tokens": 22000
      },
      {
        "id": "TB1-query-contract-citing-docs",
        "category": "T-B",
        "tier": "primary",
        "budget_tokens": 26000,
        "prompt": "在 notist 的设计文档里，有哪些文档引用了 query-contract 这篇？请列出至少五个引用方的模块名，并各用一句话说明它们各自关注什么。（回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "query-contract"
            ],
            "desc": "repeats the anchor module"
          },
          {
            "type": "stems_at_least",
            "threshold": 5,
            "stems": [
              "cli",
              "cli-command-surface-skill-distribution",
              "search-retrieval-index",
              "analyzer-snapshot",
              "core-namespace-plugin-boundary",
              "lsp-architecture-redesign",
              "navigation"
            ],
            "desc": "names >=5 citing modules"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "TC1-vector-retrieval-absence",
        "category": "T-C",
        "tier": "primary",
        "budget_tokens": 26000,
        "prompt": "notist 当前支持基于 embedding/向量的语义检索吗？官方规范层面是怎么规定的？（回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_any",
            "patterns": [
              "不支持",
              "没有实现",
              "尚未实现",
              "暂不",
              "未支持",
              "未实现",
              "架构预留",
              "预留",
              "非现行",
              "不是现行",
              "不属于现行能力",
              "no[,.]|not (yet )?(support|implement|landed)"
            ],
            "desc": "asserts vector retrieval is absent / reservation-only"
          },
          {
            "type": "pattern_any",
            "patterns": [
              "(?i)(bm25|lexical|词法|倒排)",
              "(?i)(embedd|向量).{0,24}(研究|调查|archiv|dated|非规范|roadmap|路线)",
              "只在.{0,12}(调查|研究|ai/)"
            ],
            "desc": "grounds what does exist (lexical) or locates vector talk to dated research"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "TD1-modpath-scope-byte-span",
        "category": "T-D",
        "tier": "primary",
        "budget_tokens": 18000,
        "prompt": "用 notist 给出 query-contract 设计文档中 『ModulePath Scope』 这一节的字节区间（起始与结束字节）。（回答保持精炼，不要展开解释。）",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pattern_all",
            "patterns": [
              "3927",
              "4929"
            ],
            "desc": "reports the exact byte span endpoints"
          },
          {
            "type": "pattern_any",
            "patterns": [
              "span|区间|range|字节"
            ],
            "desc": "presents it as a range"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}